# published build resolves to. The wasm is rebuilt from these sibling commits in the
# publish workflow rather than from a moving `main`, so a malicious commit on a sibling
# main cannot become a signed, provenance badged npm release. Q-Crypto enters through a
# cargo git dependency pinned in Cargo.lock at the same rev; the others enter by path
# dependency and are checked out here. Keep these in step with Cargo.lock.

